      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5bd65899aabff62baf479195",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be great to be able to set an animation override for each hand individually, so that you can have for example, 2 animations for the Thumbs Up Gesture on separate hands.\n\nThis would double the amount of gestures that we could use and open up so many more doors for awesome animations and Creative Thinking.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Animation Overrides For Individual Hands",
