  "details": "VR users have the option to use their tracking pad or something like it to make hand gestures. However, the controller is setup  in such a way that any hand has the same gestures. Meaning replacing the animation of e.g. point, will replace the animation on both hands.\n\nI'd like to suggest to separate the gestures per hand. It will allow more expressiveness for vr users who take their time to create custom animations.",
